            "review_title": "Review at Oc Nong Ha Trang",
            "review_text": "Trillussinino\nEmilia-Romagna, Italy240 contributions\n0\nSnails as if it were raining them\nOct 2026 • Solo\nSnails as if it were raining them, boiled with some herbs and then to be dipped in a ginger concoction. No one feels bad, even if you are in the middle of the street and the two ladies are cooking on the sidewalk. If you also want the fried pork bites, they are out of this world. Then drink elsewhere\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Italian\nShow original\nWritten October 3, 2026",
