            "review_text": "A Traveller's Diary\nBrighton, United Kingdom254 contributions\n0\nDelicious\nApr 2025 • Couples\nDelicious snails! We got the big ones. They reminded me of the ones I used to eat in Italy as a child. My granfather used to pick them up and my grandmother used to cook them with tosato sauce. These ones are served with a sweet sauce. Really nice.\nWritten April 7, 2025",
