            "review_text": "SimonaCornelia\nCluj-Napoca, Romania69 contributions\n0\nExquisite Vietnamese Snails and Clams\nDec 2022 • Couples\nThis is clearly a local hotspot! First I noticed it was very crowded, not even a free table, on the contrary, they even put extra table opposite and those were also occupied. People seemed to be enjoying very much, and that intrigued me and wanted to eat there. It took some 10 minutes to get a table.\n\nSeated on small plastic chairs, in the midst of the locals we were excited for the experience. We ordered snails, frog legs (they bring them from a neighbour lady), kumquat juice and beer.\nOmg!!! The freshness and taste of everything! First, they brought us a huge bowl of garlic and chilli, and another one of very flavourful green herbs, all to accompany the dishes.\nWhat followed was a real feast of joy and awe!\n\nWhile we were enjoying our meals, we noticed some clams at our table neighbours and we ordered a portion of those too. Omg!!! The broth the clams were cooked in was something out of this world: pineapple, lemongrass and I don’t know what else, but it was amazing! Very fragrant, fresh and nourishing!\n\nIt’s a small restaurant but oh, they cook amazing, besides the quality ingredients they put a lot of soul and smiles into their dishes.\nWe both felt very satisfied and left excited to dive deeper into the exquisite Vietnamese.\n\nHighly recommend them!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten April 3, 2023",
