            "review_text": "Erin P\nBrisbane, Australia16 contributions\n0\nAmazing clams\nAug 2019 • Couples\nInitially felt nervous to dine here as we had difficulty getting the attention of staff to be seated. It paid to be more assertive at this business as it is clearly a local hotspot. \n\nSeated on small plastic chairs inside and were excited for our authentic experience. Ordered big snails and clams and Hanoi beer. \n\nClams were the standout due to the light and fragrant broth they were in. Snails were pretty good. Felt satisfied after the meal and it felt like we were in the midst of the locals.\nRead more\nWritten August 15, 2019",
